# Chat agent — the Google AI Studio key lives SERVER-SIDE ONLY.
# Make one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey, then:
#   cp .env.example .env.local   (paste the key below)
#   npm run rag:index            (rebuild api/rag-index.json, then commit it)
#   npm run chat:dev             (local /api on :8787 for `npm run dev`)
#
# On Vercel: add GEMINI_API_KEY in Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables. The key never touches the SPA bundle.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# GitHub Pages builds host no function — point the widget at the
# deployed Vercel function instead (/api stays correct when the SPA
# itself is served by Vercel). Set in the Pages build environment:
# VITE_CHAT_API_URL=https://<your-agent>.vercel.app/api
